<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;I have an error that says I do not have "Mailer.pm" in @INC
&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Not quite - it says that you do not have 'Mail/Mailer.pm' in @INC. As there is no 'Mail/Mailer.pm' in &lt;c&gt;/usr/local/share/perl5/Mail&lt;/c&gt; it will not find it there. Repalce that entry in @INC with the correct one: &lt;c&gt;/usr/local/share/perl5&lt;/c&gt; and you will probably have more luck.&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
